OL,5,G2000 The Briefing Room
OL,6,     FWhy are fewer people are forming
OL,7,     Frelationships? There are all kinds
OL,8,     Fof theories about why this is
OL,9,     Fhappening. So what do we know
OL,10,     Fabout this noncoupling and its
OL,11,     Fimplications?
OL,12,G2030 BBC Inside Science
OL,13,     FThe lab-created 'SpudCell' is
OL,14,     Farguably the most complete
OL,15,     Fsynthetic cell developed to date.
OL,16,     FBut is it really the turning point
OL,17,     Fin synthetic biology that some
OL,18,     Fpeople think?
